      "summary": "Thread runtime statistics"
    },
    {
      "type": "Requirement",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:requirements/ZEP-SRS-1-29",
      "requirementStatement": "Where thread runtime statistics are enabled, the Zephyr RTOS shall provide a mechanism to query the total runtime usage statistics across all threads.",
