      "spdxId": "zephyr:requirements/ZEP-SRS-5-9",
      "requirementStatement": "When attempting to acquire a semaphore, the Zephyr RTOS shall accept options that specify timeout periods, allowing threads to set a maximum wait time for semaphore acquisition.",
